List, train, attach and detach the models that judge decisions

Usage: lighthouse model [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List the models bound to decisions
  train   Fit a model on the labels of a decision
  attach  Make a model the first layer of a decision, by a revision
  detach  Remove the model a revision attached to a decision
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <FILE>  The project file; the project root is then the current directory [env: LIGHTHOUSE_CONFIG=]
      --color <COLOR>  Color of help and messages. `auto` honours NO_COLOR and CLICOLOR_FORCE [env: LIGHTHOUSE_COLOR=] [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -h, --help           Print help
